        "_key": "mt08a",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "Patients decide whether to trust a clinic within the **first 5 seconds** on its website.",
          "Trust is built by **real photos**, a calm palette, a visible booking button, transparent prices",
          "Trust is killed by stock smiles, carousels, aggressive popups, small grey text",
          "Speed is design too: a beautiful but slow site loses patients",
          "Our case: the Efedra clinic redesign delivered **3.2× more enquiries**"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt08b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt08c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The 5 seconds that decide everything"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt08d",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt08e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A patient opens 3–5 clinic websites in a row and compares. A few seconds each. In that time they don't read copy — they read signals. Tidy or not. Real people or stock. Obvious where to click, or not. Design is the first trust filter, and it does its work before the patient learns anything about your practitioners."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt08f",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt08g",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What builds trust"
