            "_key": "mt08k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "A calm palette with one accent. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "mt08l",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Healthcare is light and air. One accent colour — for the booking button and key actions, no more."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt08p",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt08n",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "A booking button on every screen. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "mt08o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Patient ready on screen three? Button's right there. Scrolled to the price list? Button's right there. Don't make them hunt."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt08s",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt08q",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Typography for a 60+ audience. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "mt08r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "At least 16px body text and high contrast. If a grandmother can't read the price list, you've lost her — and the daughter who opened the site for her."
